(7743588, 1277885, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, yes, this takes me back to when father used to have the chauffer take us kids to the fanciest restaurant in town and let us eat the most expensive treats and then drop us off at the airport where we would take the family jet to Disneyland where we had exclusive access to all the rides and attractions all day. Frankly, I liked the weekends on the yacht more.</td>', 'Ahhh, yes, this takes me back to when father used to have the chauffer take us kids to the fanciest restaurant in town and let us eat the most expensive treats and then drop us off at the airport where we would take the family jet to Disneyland where we had exclusive access to all the rides and attractions all day. Frankly, I liked the weekends on the yacht more.', '2023-05-03 01:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
