(7743638, 1277568, 30861, '<td valign="top">221 is my spirit number :-) For this I give you a point. I love that Ferrari (I''m a car nut) so 2 points there. Every image starts with a 5, then I add and deduct. So at this point, you''re at an 8. I realize it''s minimal, but the framing still distracts, it''s too tight, so that gets you back to 7.<br/> <br/>Wasn''t that a nice mini-race? Seriously, I don''t actually vote that way but that''s how I sum up my reaction to this one. 7 it is. Gorgeous red, BTW. Ferrari has the best red in the world and you''ve nailed it.</td>', '221 is my spirit number :-) For this I give you a point. I love that Ferrari (I''m a car nut) so 2 points there. Every image starts with a 5, then I add and deduct. So at this point, you''re at an 8. I realize it''s minimal, but the framing still distracts, it''s too tight, so that gets you back to 7. Wasn''t that a nice mini-race? Seriously, I don''t actually vote that way but that''s how I sum up my reaction to this one. 7 it is. Gorgeous red, BTW. Ferrari has the best red in the world and you''ve nailed it.', '2023-05-03 10:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7743651, 1277903, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nope, no flower LOL. But much red. Not sure about your focal point; I''m a traditionalist and prefer the closest part of an object in focus. But still, kudos for finding an interesting unflower.</td>', 'Nope, no flower LOL. But much red. Not sure about your focal point; I''m a traditionalist and prefer the closest part of an object in focus. But still, kudos for finding an interesting unflower.', '2023-05-03 12:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
