(7744235, 1277508, 30049, '<td valign="top">Certainly nailed the red on this.  Feels just a smidge underexposed and a little attention to removing the dirt specks before capture would have improved the overall appeal. Maybe they''re dings in the paint?  Sorry, can''t tell.</td>', 'Certainly nailed the red on this.  Feels just a smidge underexposed and a little attention to removing the dirt specks before capture would have improved the overall appeal. Maybe they''re dings in the paint?  Sorry, can''t tell.', '2023-05-09 23:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
