(7744286, 1277568, 29269, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> 221 is my spirit number :-) For this I give you a point. I love that Ferrari (I''m a car nut) so 2 points there. Every image starts with a 5, then I add and deduct. So at this point, you''re at an 8. I realize it''s minimal, but the framing still distracts, it''s too tight, so that gets you back to 7.<br/> <br/>Wasn''t that a nice mini-race? Seriously, I don''t actually vote that way but that''s how I sum up my reaction to this one. 7 it is. Gorgeous red, BTW. Ferrari has the best red in the world and you''ve nailed it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Robert! I was sitting in the pit lane, with a 50mm on, and tried to pan the cars going by... this was not cropped at all on the sides :) next time (if there''s next time) I''ll try to put a wider lens.</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: 221 is my spirit number :-) For this I give you a point. I love that Ferrari (I''m a car nut) so 2 points there. Every image starts with a 5, then I add and deduct. So at this point, you''re at an 8. I realize it''s minimal, but the framing still distracts, it''s too tight, so that gets you back to 7. Wasn''t that a nice mini-race? Seriously, I don''t actually vote that way but that''s how I sum up my reaction to this one. 7 it is. Gorgeous red, BTW. Ferrari has the best red in the world and you''ve nailed it.   Thanks Robert! I was sitting in the pit lane, with a 50mm on, and tried to pan the cars going by... this was not cropped at all on the sides :) next time (if there''s next time) I''ll try to put a wider lens.', '2023-05-10 10:48:09.000000', NULL, 0),
